    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The wizard transforms his leg (but not his clothes, shoes or the other items he wears) into the body and legs of an equine, assuming the form of a centaur. He keeps his stats except for Movement which becomes the same as the chosen animal. The spell can be cancelled at will. If he suffers a wound, he must make a successful <strong>Hard (-2 SL) Willpower</strong> Test to maintain this form.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></p>"
